  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>The jazz scene seen as never before. Bille, Bird, Basie: JAZZFEST GALLERY spotlights the artwork of midcentury jazz record album design. Restored meticulous, faithful, and authentic from original vintage plates, our EXCLUSIVE limited edition fine art collection headlines the heppest jazz cats who sing a Tin Pan Alley songbook and swing the 52nd Street clubs.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>The JazzFest Gallery offers a curated collection of fine art prints of classic jazz album covers. These limited edition prints are restored from original vintage plates and feature iconic midcentury musicians. Their USP lies in the unique blend of historical authenticity, quality, exclusivity, and artistic value. Payment terms include various sizes of prints with specified prices, inclusive of global shipping and free returns. For more detailed information, visit&nbsp;</span><a target=\"_new\" href=\"https://jazzfestgallery.com/\">jazzfestgallery.com</a><span>.</span></p>",
